<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Skywrite — third-party licenses</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 70rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
    pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Skywrite — third-party licenses</h1>
  <p>Licenses of the third-party crates compiled into the <code>skywrite</code> release binaries, and the crates that use each license.</p>
  <p>The embedded Geist font is covered separately by the SIL Open Font License in <code>fonts-OFL.txt</code>, included in each release archive.</p>
  <p>Every crate listed here is used unmodified. The source code of each one, including the MPL-2.0 crates, is available from <a href="https://crates.io">crates.io</a> at the version shown.</p>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section>
    <h2>{{name}}</h2>
    <ul>
      {{#each used_by}}
      <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
